  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "未來世界：美麗？哀愁？",
    "sub_ename": "THE FUTURE WORLD: BEAUTIFUL? SORROW?",
    "describe_ch": "科技給人類生活帶來前所未有的便利，以致人類對科技越來越依賴，隨之而來的倫理、道德等挑戰與問題卻更值得深思。本課程將以智慧醫療、智慧商務的實際案例引導學生了解未來科技發展的趨勢，並思考科技對未來世界的影響，以不同的視角來探索未來科技與永續生活的連結。課程將以下列三單元進行\n單元一：導論，科技發展對人類社會的影響（利與弊），科技發展VS文學、藝術、法律、道德，探討文學、藝術、法律、道德在人類社會的重要性。\n單元二：精準醫療，AI對疾病治療提供解方之外，同時也帶來新的挑戰，本課程將探討AI治療所衍生出的倫理與法律問題、人造人等道德、法律各面向的問題。\n單元三：精準行銷，管理學上的生產、行銷、人資、研發、財務等所有維度都因為科技發展產生質與量的衝擊，學習用更寬廣的視角透視進化並探討衍生的問題。",
    "describe_eh": "Technology has brought unprecedented convenience to human life, causing humans to become more and more dependent on technology. The challenges and issues such as ethics and morality that come with it are more worth pondering. This course will use practical cases of smart medical care and smart business to guide students to understand the future development trends of science and technology, think about the impact of technology on the future world, and explore the connection between future technology and sustainable life from different perspectives. The course will be conducted in the following three units\nUnit 1: Introduction, the impact of scientific and technological development on human society (pros and cons), scientific and technological development VS literature, art, law, and morality, and explore the importance of literature, art, law, and morality in human society.\nUnit 2: Precision Medicine, AI not only provides solutions to disease treatment, but also brings new challenges. This course will Discuss the ethical and legal issues arising from AI therapy, the social morality of artificial humans, etc.\nUnit 3: Precision Marketing, all aspects of management such as production, marketing, human resources, research and development, and finance are all due to science and echnology. Technological development has produced qualitative and quantitative impacts, and it is urgent to learn to see the pace of evolution from a broader perspective.",
